<title>UK: Essen Hypo adds 500 million marks to Feb 2004 bond.</title>
<headline>Essen Hypo adds 500 million marks to Feb 2004 bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers Trinkaus &amp; Burkhardt, ABN AMRO, Bayerische Hypotheken- und WechselBank, Commerzbank and Dresdner Bank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   HYPOTHEKENBANK IN ESSEN</p>
<p> AMT    *1.5 BLN DEM  COUPON     5.75	MATURITY    06.FEB.04</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  98.61     PAY DATE  **19.SEP.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  0.31	REOFFER    =	   SPREAD	 =</p>
<p> NOTES	*ORIGINAL 1.0 BLN DEM LAUNCHED 31.JAN.96</p>
<p>	     **PLUS ACCRUED INTEREST</p>
<p> MOODY	=	   LISTING    DDF	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  =	   DENOMS (K) ONE	 SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.08	SELL CONC  0.23	PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES	OEFFENTLICHE PFANDBRIEF 426</p>
